spec ww02-stale-snapshot-write-lpg: 2 sessions, 6 permutations
# WW02 through the lpg API over the same graph: the same two transactions as the
# Cypher arm, opened with Session.BeginVersionedTx and written with
# ApplyInVersionedTx. The verdicts must match the Cypher arm.

starting permutation: s1w s1c s2w s2c
step s1w: lpg: SetNodeProperty(n, v, 1)
step s1c: lpg: Session.EndVersionedTx
step s2w: lpg: SetNodeProperty(n, v, 2)
ERROR: serialization conflict
step s2c: lpg: Session.EndVersionedTx
ERROR: serialization conflict
final final: MATCH (n:Item {name:'n'}) RETURN n.v AS v
v
